{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Intent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Intent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.discrepancy_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.discrepancy_swap","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L42-L45","doc":"The discrepancy is antisymmetric under swapping the two observers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.discrepancy_eq_zero_of_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.discrepancy_eq_zero_of_commute","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L36-L40","doc":"If the two observations commute at `a`, the discrepancy vanishes — the\nparallelogram closes (no `ℏ_q`-controlled defect). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.discrepancy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.discrepancy","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L33-L34","doc":"The two-observer discrepancy at a state `a`: `𝔒₁(𝔒₂ a) − 𝔒₂(𝔒₁ a)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.obs₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.obs₂","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Second observer's observation morphism `𝔒₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.obs₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.obs₁","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L25-L25","doc":"First observer's observation morphism `𝔒₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Intent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Intent","kind":"structure","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Intent.lean#L18-L27","doc":"Data for a two-observer observation record.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the ambient observable algebra `A` and two\nobservation morphisms `𝔒₁, 𝔒₂ : A → A`. The two-observer discrepancy is\ntheir commutator. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:observation","label":"def:observation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/observation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}